* XNOR2V1_90S9T20R for VA/NN: same topology as CDL, d/s swapped where needed.
* CDL: X11(6 A2 VSS VSS)..X22(ZN 4 VDD VDD). X14: VSS 6 10 -> swap to 10 6 VSS VSS. X20: VDD 6 20 -> swap to 20 6 VDD VDD.
* X19: CDL 20 A1 4 VDD => when A1 low we need 4 from 20 (current 20->4), so d=4 s=20 => 4 A1 20 VDD.
.SUBCKT XNOR2V1_90S9T20R A1 A2 VDD VNW VPW VSS ZN
X11 6 A2 VSS VSS mos14n
X12 4 A1 6 VSS mos14n
X13 10 7 4 VSS mos14n
X14 10 6 VSS VSS mos14n
X15 7 A1 VSS VSS mos14n
X16 ZN 4 VSS VSS mos14n
X17 6 A2 VDD VDD mos14p
X18 4 7 6 VDD mos14p
X19 4 A1 20 VDD mos14p
X20 20 6 VDD VDD mos14p
X21 7 A1 VDD VDD mos14p
X22 ZN 4 VDD VDD mos14p
.ENDS XNOR2V1_90S9T20R
